msgid "The type of ping packet to sent.  <br><i>NOTE: ICMP on Linux/UNIX requires root privileges.</i>  <br><i>NOTE: TCP Ping Closed - Even if the tcp ping is not successful, the device can be considered UP.</i>"
msgstr "Die tipe ping-pakket om te stuur.  <br><i>LET WEL: ICMP op Linux/UNIX vereis wortelregte.</i>  <br><i>LET WEL: TCP-ping gesluit - Selfs al is die tcp-ping nie suksesvol nie, kan die toestel as OP beskou word.</i>"

