msgid "The width (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Die breedte (in pieksels) van die grafiekarea binne die grafiek. Hierdie area sluit nie die legende, as-legendes of titel in nie."

