#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Kadupul handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Kadupul.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Kadupul resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Ingeboude stawing</i> - Kadupul hanteer gebruikersstawing, wat jou toelaat om gebruikers te skep en vir hulle regte tot verskillende dele binne Kadupul te gee.<br><br><i>Basiese webstawing</i> - Stawing word deur die webbediener hanteer. Gebruikers kan outomaties by die eerste aanmelding bygevoeg of geskep word as die sjabloongebruiker gedefinieer is, anders sal die gedefinieerde gastetoestemmings gebruik word.<br><br><i>LDAP-stawing</i> - Laat stawing teen 'n LDAP-bediener toe. Gebruikers sal outomaties by die eerste aanmelding geskep word as die sjabloongebruiker gedefinieer is, anders sal die gedefinieerde gastetoestemmings gebruik word. As PHP se LDAP-module nie geaktiveer is nie, sal LDAP-stawing nie as 'n kiesbare opsie verskyn nie.<br><br><i>Veelvuldige LDAP/AD-domeinstawing</i> - Laat administrateurs toe om veelvuldige uiteenlopende groepe vanaf verskillende LDAP/AD-gidse te ondersteun om toegang tot Kadupul-hulpbronne te kry. Net soos LDAP-stawing word die PHP LDAP-module vereis om hierdie metode te gebruik.</blockquote>"

