#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Kadupul's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Die maksimum hoeveelheid tyd wat 'n Kadupul Spikekill-skrip kan loop sonder om 'n tydlimietfout te genereer en gestop te word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum number of Device Directories to be created based upon hashed Device ID's."
msgstr "Die maksimum aantal Toestelgidse wat geskep word gebaseer op gehashte Toestel-ID's."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum size of the E-Mail message including all attachments."
msgstr "Die maksimum grootte van die E-posboodskap insluitend alle aanhegsels."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat spine sal wag vir 'n skrip om te voltooi.  Hierdie tydlimietwaarde is in sekondes en is slegs geldig vir die spine-dataversamelaar."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The method used to Clean RRDfiles from Kadupul after their Data Sources are deleted."
msgstr "Die metode wat gebruik word om RRD-lêers uit Kadupul skoon te maak nadat hul Databronne geskrap is."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The most refused samples one data source may keep queued.  The oldest samples beyond this limit are moved to the poller_output_rejected table immediately."
msgstr "Die meeste geweierde monsters wat een databron in die tou mag hou.  Die oudste monsters bo hierdie limiet word onmiddellik na die poller_output_rejected-tabel geskuif."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Die naam van die gasgebruiker om grafieke te bekyk; is by verstek 'Geen gebruiker'."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Kadupul system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Die naam van die primêre administratiewe rekening wat outomaties E-posse sal ontvang wanneer die Kadupul-stelsel probleme ondervind.  Om hierdie E-posse te ontvang, maak seker dat jou posinstellings korrek is en dat die administratiewe rekening 'n E-posadres het wat gestel is."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Kadupul will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Die naam van die gebruiker wat Kadupul as 'n sjabloon vir nuwe Web Basic- en LDAP-gebruikers sal gebruik; is by verstek 'guest'.  Hierdie gebruikersrekening sal gedeaktiveer word om aan te meld sodra dit gekies is."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of alert rules read and evaluated together. The time budget is checked between batches."
msgstr ""

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of columns to use when displaying Thumbnail graphs in Preview mode."
msgstr "Die aantal kolomme om te gebruik wanneer Duimnaelskets-grafieke in Voorskoumodus vertoon word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of columns to use when displaying Thumbnail graphs in Tree mode."
msgstr "Die aantal kolomme om te gebruik wanneer Duimnaelskets-grafieke in Boommodus vertoon word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent DSStats processes to use to use to process all of the Data Sources."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige DSStats-prosesse om te gebruik om al die Databronne te verwerk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  The will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige Poller-opdragprosesse.  Daar sal hoogstens een gelyktydige opdrag per gasheer binne die Poller-opdragpoel wees."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent RRDfile check processes to use to use to process all of rrd files."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige RRD-lêer-toetsprosesse om te gebruik om al die rrd-lêers te verwerk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige boost-prosesse om te gebruik om al die RRDs in die boost-tabel te verwerk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige skripbedienerprosesse om per spine-proses te laat loop.  Instellings tussen 1 en 15 word aanvaar.  Hierdie parameter sal help as jy verskeie drade en skripbedienerskripte laat loop en is slegs geldig vir die spine-dataversamelaar."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of consecutive hours that represent the hourly average.  Keep in mind that a setting too high can result in very large memory tables"
msgstr "Die aantal opeenvolgende ure wat die uurlikse gemiddelde verteenwoordig.  Hou in gedagte dat 'n te hoë instelling tot baie groot geheuetabelle kan lei"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of graphs to display on one page in preview mode."
msgstr "Die aantal grafieke om op een bladsy in voorskoumodus te vertoon."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must be down before logging an error and reporting Device as down."
msgstr "Die aantal peilingsintervalle wat 'n Toestel af moet wees voordat 'n fout aangeteken word en Toestel as af gerapporteer word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must remain up before returning Device to an up status and issuing a notice."
msgstr "Die aantal peilingsintervalle wat 'n Toestel op moet bly voordat Toestel na 'n op-status terugkeer en 'n kennisgewing uitgereik word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of seconds between automatic page refreshes."
msgstr "Die aantal sekondes tussen outomatiese bladsyverfrissings."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of times Kadupul will attempt to ping a Device before marking it as down."
msgstr "Die aantal kere wat Kadupul sal probeer om 'n Toestel te ping voordat dit as af gemerk word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The password to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Die wagwoord om mee te verifieer wanneer daar via SMTP gestuur word. (Laat leeg as jy nie verifikasie benodig nie.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to Spine binary."
msgstr "Die pad na Spine binêre lêer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to Spine configuration file.  By default, in the cwd of Spine, or /etc if not specified."
msgstr "Die pad na Spine-konfigurasielêer.  By verstek, in die cwd van Spine, of /etc indien nie gespesifiseer nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to the rrdtool binary."
msgstr "Die pad na die rrdtool binêre lêer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your Kadupul log file (if blank, defaults to &lt;path_cacti&gt;/log/cacti.log)"
msgstr "Die pad na jou Kadupul-loglêer (indien leeg, verstek na &lt;path_cacti&gt;/log/cacti.log)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your PHP binary file (may require a php recompile to get this file)."
msgstr "Die pad na jou PHP binêre lêer (mag 'n php-herkompilasie vereis om hierdie lêer te kry)."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your snmpbulkwalk binary."
msgstr "Die pad na jou snmpbulkwalk binêre lêer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your snmpget binary."
msgstr "Die pad na jou snmpget binêre lêer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your snmpgetnext binary."
msgstr "Die pad na jou snmpgetnext binêre lêer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your snmptrap binary."
msgstr "Die pad na jou snmptrap binêre lêer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your snmpwalk binary."
msgstr "Die pad na jou snmpwalk binêre lêer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take affect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Die poller-tipe om te gebruik.  Hierdie instelling sal by die volgende peilingsinterval in werking tree."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Die peilingsinterval wat gebruik word.  Hierdie instelling sal beïnvloed hoe gereeld RRD-lêers nagegaan en bygewerk word.  <strong><u>LET WEL: As jy hierdie waarde verander, moet jy die poller-kas weer vul.  Versuim om dit te doen, kan tot verlore data lei.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The port on the SMTP Server to use."
msgstr "Die poort op die SMTP-bediener om te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The size of the font used for Graph Axis"
msgstr "Die grootte van die lettertipe wat vir Grafiek-as gebruik word"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The size of the font used for Graph Legend items"
msgstr "Die grootte van die lettertipe wat vir Grafieklegende-items gebruik word"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The size of the font used for Graph Titles"
msgstr "Die grootte van die lettertipe wat vir Grafiektitels gebruik word"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The size of the font used for Graph Units"
msgstr "Die grootte van die lettertipe wat vir Grafiekeenhede gebruik word"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The time your business hours end. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Die tyd waarop jou besigheidsure eindig. Formaat: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The time your business hours start. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Die tyd waarop jou besigheidsure begin. Formaat: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The username to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Die gebruikersnaam om mee te verifieer wanneer daar via SMTP gestuur word. (Laat leeg as jy nie verifikasie benodig nie.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The version of RRDtool that you have installed."
msgstr "Die weergawe van RRDtool wat jy geïnstalleer het."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The width of Thumbnail graphs in pixels."
msgstr "Die breedte van Duimnaelskets-grafieke in pieksels."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Tema"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Theme Settings"
msgstr "Tema-instellings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Daar is drie vervangingsmetodes.  Die eerste metode vervang die piek met die gemiddelde van die betrokke databron.  Die tweede metode vervang die piek met 'n 'NaN'.  Die laaste vervang die piek met die laaste bekende goeie waarde wat gevind is."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Daar is twee verwyderingsmetodes.  Die eerste, Standaardafwyking, sal enige monster verwyder wat X aantal standaardafwykings weg van die gemiddelde van monsters is.  Die tweede metode, Variansie, sal enige monster verwyder wat X% meer as die Variansie-gemiddelde is.  Die Variansie-metode neem 'n sekere aantal 'uitskieters' in ag.  Dit is uitsonderlike monsters, soos die piek, wat uit die Variansie-gemiddelde-berekening uitgesluit moet word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Hierdie instellings word op die Dataversamelaar-vlak onderhou.  Die waardes hier is slegs verstekwaardes wat gebruik word wanneer 'n Dataversamelaar die eerste keer geskep word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is a Email account used for sending a test message to ensure everything is working properly."
msgstr "Hierdie is 'n E-posrekening wat gebruik word om 'n toetsboodskap te stuur om te verseker dat alles behoorlik werk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is a the server location that will be used for links to the Kadupul site. This should include the subdirectory if Kadupul does not run from root folder."
msgstr "Hierdie is die bedienerligging wat vir skakels na die Kadupul-werf gebruik sal word. Dit moet die subgids insluit as Kadupul nie vanaf die wortelgids loop nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is how many characters will be allowed before a line in the Email is automatically word wrapped. (0 = Disabled)"
msgstr "Hierdie is hoeveel karakters toegelaat sal word voordat 'n reël in die E-pos outomaties omgevou word. (0 = Gedeaktiveer)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "Hierdie is die maksimum aantal dae voordat 'n wagwoord gestel word om te verval."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Hierdie is die maksimum aantal dae voordat onaktiewe rekeninge gedeaktiveer word.  Die Admin-rekening word van hierdie beleid uitgesluit."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Hierdie is die minimum lengte van toegelate wagwoorde."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Hierdie is die E-posadres waarvandaan die E-pos sal verskyn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Hierdie is die werklike naam waarvandaan die E-pos sal verskyn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the directory where RRDfiles are <strong>moved</strong> for archiving"
msgstr "Hierdie is die gids waarheen RRD-lêers <strong>geskuif</strong> word vir argivering"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the hostname/IP of the SMTP Server you will send the Email to. For failover, separate your hosts using a semi-colon."
msgstr "Hierdie is die gasheernaam/IP van die SMTP-bediener waarheen jy die E-pos sal stuur. Vir oorskakeling (failover), skei jou gashere met 'n kommapunt."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the location, on the web server where the RRDfiles and PNG files will be cached.  This cache will be managed by the poller.  Make sure you have the correct read and write permissions on this folder"
msgstr "Hierdie is die ligging op die webbediener waar die RRD-lêers en PNG-lêers gekas sal word.  Hierdie kas sal deur die poller bestuur word.  Maak seker jy het die korrekte lees- en skryftoestemmings op hierdie gids"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal supported time between Graph updates.  This value is also used to set certain RRDfile attributes.  If you have a Device that caches data and does not provide realtime updates, you may have to increase the default Minimum Refresh Interval to prevent creating Graphs with gaps."
msgstr "Hierdie is die minimum ondersteunde tyd tussen Grafiekbywerkings.  Hierdie waarde word ook gebruik om sekere RRD-lêer-eienskappe te stel.  As jy 'n Toestel het wat data kas en nie intydse bywerkings verskaf nie, moet jy dalk die verstek Minimum Verfris-interval verhoog om te verhoed dat Grafieke met gapings geskep word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the path to sendmail on your server. (Only used if Sendmail is selected as the Mail Service)"
msgstr "Hierdie is die pad na sendmail op jou bediener. (Word slegs gebruik as Sendmail as die Posdiens gekies is)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This option will rotate the Kadupul Log periodically."
msgstr "Hierdie opsie sal die Kadupul-log periodiek roteer."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "Hierdie verwys na die spesifieke attribuut binne die LDAP-gids wat die gebruikersname van groeplede hou. Dit is noodsaaklik om te verseker dat die attribuutwaarde ooreenstem met die konfigurasie wat in die \"Onderskeidende Naam\" gespesifiseer is of dat die werklike attribuutwaarde deursoekbaar is met die instellings wat in die \"Onderskeidende Naam\" uiteengesit is."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Hierdie instelling is slegs vir enkel-poller-stelsels om die poller-uitvoertabel op elke peilingsiklus te herbou om te verhoed dat die geheuetabel omruil (swap) op baie groot stelsels met groot databasisse wat omruilgeheue kan gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This timespan you wish to see on the default graph."
msgstr "Hierdie tydspan wat jy op die verstekgrafiek wil sien."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph RRA."
msgstr "Hierdie waarde verteenwoordig die maksimum aantal pieke om uit 'n Grafiek-RRA te verwyder."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Hierdie waarde verteenwoordig die aantal hoë en lae gemiddelde monsters wat uit die monsterstel verwyder sal word voordat die Variansie-gemiddelde bereken word.  As jy 'n uitskieterwaarde van 5 kies, word beide die boonste en onderste 5 gemiddeldes verwyder."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Hierdie waarde verteenwoordig die persentasie bo die aangepaste monstergemiddelde nadat uitskieters uit die monster verwyder is.  Byvoorbeeld, 'n Variansiepersentasie van 100%% op 'n aangepaste gemiddelde van 50 sal enige monster bo die hoeveelheid van 100 uit die grafiek verwyder."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "Hierdie sal vereis dat alle ou wagwoorde ook by aanmelding aan die nuwe kompleksiteitsvereistes voldoen.  As dit nie nagekom word nie, sal dit 'n wagwoordverandering afdwing."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 numerical character."
msgstr "Hierdie sal vereis dat nuwe wagwoorde ten minste 1 syferkarakter bevat."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 special character."
msgstr "Hierdie sal vereis dat nuwe wagwoorde ten minste 1 spesiale karakter bevat."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contains both lower and upper-case characters."
msgstr "Hierdie sal vereis dat nuwe wagwoorde beide klein- en hoofletterkarakters bevat."

