#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What time of day should Weekly, Monthly, and Yearly Data be updated?  Format is HH:MM [am/pm]"
msgstr "Watter tyd van die dag moet Weeklikse, Maandelikse en Jaarlikse Data bygewerk word?  Formaat is HH:MM [am/pm]"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When SpikeKill kills spikes in graphs, it makes a backup of the RRDfile.  How long should these backup files be retained?"
msgstr "Wanneer SpikeKill pieke in grafieke verwyder, maak dit 'n rugsteun van die RRD-lêer.  Hoe lank moet hierdie rugsteunlêers behou word?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When an option is checked, users will be able to put Kadupul into Real-time mode."
msgstr "Wanneer 'n opsie gemerk is, sal gebruikers Kadupul in Intydse modus kan plaas."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Wanneer boost bywerkingsopdragte na RRDtool stuur, mag dit nie die bedryfstelsel se Maksimum Argumentlengte oorskry nie.  Dit wissel volgens bedryfstelsel en kernvlak.  Byvoorbeeld: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ onbeperk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Wanneer gemerk, sal Vorm- en Instellinghulp inlyn gewys word.  Andersins sal dit aangebied word wanneer jy oor die hulpknoppie beweeg."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Kadupul will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Wanneer gemerk, sal enige pogings om toegang tot Kadupul te verkry na HTTPS herlei word om hoë sekuriteit te verseker."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When creating a new report, what image type should be used for the inline graphs."
msgstr "Wanneer 'n nuwe verslag geskep word, watter beeldtipe moet vir die inlyngrafieke gebruik word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When creating graphs, what Graph Type would you like preselected?"
msgstr "Wanneer grafieke geskep word, watter Grafiektipe wil jy voorafgekies hê?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Kadupul Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Wanneer gedeaktiveer, sal Kadupul-outomatisering nie aktief enige Grafiek skep nie.  Dit is nuttig wanneer Toestelinstellings aangepas word om te verhoed dat nuwe Grafieke geskep word elke keer as jy 'n objek stoor.  Die handmatige aanroep van Outomatiseringsreëls sal steeds moontlik wees."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Kadupul Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Wanneer gedeaktiveer, sal Kadupul-outomatisering nie aktief enige Boomitem skep nie.  Dit is nuttig wanneer Toestel- of Grafiekinstellings aangepas word om te verhoed dat nuwe Boominskrywings geskep word elke keer as jy 'n objek stoor.  Die handmatige aanroep van Reëls sal steeds moontlik wees."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When displaying Graphs, allow Graph Dates to extend 'to future'"
msgstr "Wanneer Grafieke vertoon word, laat toe dat Grafiekdatums 'na toekoms' strek"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Kadupul will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Wanneer geaktiveer, sal Kadupul nie Grafieke sluit nie.  Dit laat 'n vinniger handmatige wysiging van Databronne verwant aan 'n Grafiek toe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Kadupul will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Kadupul will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Wanneer geaktiveer, sal Kadupul Radioknoppie stel om verwante Databronne van 'n Grafiek te Skrap wanneer Grafieke verwyder word.  Let wel: Kadupul sal nie die verwydering van Databronne toelaat as dit in ander Grafieke gebruik word nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When not using Theme based font control, the Pango font description to use for all Graphs, such as DejaVu Sans. Optionally, you may leave blank and control font settings on a per object basis."
msgstr "Wanneer Temagebaseerde lettertipebeheer nie gebruik word nie, die Pango-lettertipebeskrywing om vir alle Grafieke te gebruik, soos DejaVu Sans. Opsioneel kan jy dit leeg laat en lettertipe-instellings op 'n per-objek-basis beheer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When performing batch spike removal, only the templates selected below will be acted on."
msgstr "Wanneer bondel-piekverwydering uitgevoer word, sal slegs die sjablone hieronder gekies aangeraak word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using Syslog/Eventlog for logging, the Kadupul log messages that will be forwarded to the Syslog/Eventlog."
msgstr "Wanneer Syslog/Eventlog vir logboekhouding gebruik word, die Kadupul-logboodskappe wat na die Syslog/Eventlog aangestuur sal word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Wanneer basiese verifikasie gebruik word, as die basiese rekening na 'n ander aanmeldrekening vertaal moet word, kan jy hier 'n CSV-lêer spesifiseer om die basiese rekening aan die verlangde aanmeldrekening te karteer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Kadupul account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Wanneer basiese verifikasie gebruik word, as daar probleme is om die gebruikersnaam aan 'n geldige Kadupul-rekening te karteer, sal die boodskap hier ingesluit aan gebruikers vertoon word.  Dit kan beide teks en HTML insluit."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When viewing Device name filter dropdowns, checking this option will strip to domain from the hostname."
msgstr "Wanneer Toestelnaam-filteraftreklyste bekyk word, sal die merk van hierdie opsie die domein van die gasheernaam afstroop."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Wanneer jy boost aktiveer, word jou RRD-lêers slegs bygewerk wanneer dit deur 'n gebruiker aangevra word, of wanneer hierdie tydperk verstryk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which Directory Pattern do you wish to use for Structured RRD Paths.  'Device ID' is the default.  The setting 'Device ID/Data Query ID' should be used when you have Devices with thousands of Graphs.  After Changing the Directory Pattern, you must run the Structured Path CLI script again to modify the RRDfile paths to the new Pattern."
msgstr "Watter Gidspatroon wil jy vir Gestruktureerde RRD-paaie gebruik.  'Toestel-ID' is die verstek.  Die instelling 'Toestel-ID/Datanavraag-ID' moet gebruik word wanneer jy Toestelle met duisende Grafieke het.  Nadat jy die Gidspatroon verander het, moet jy die Gestruktureerde Pad CLI-skrip weer uitvoer om die RRD-lêerpaaie na die nuwe Patroon te wysig."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which Graph mode you want displayed by default when you first visit the Graphs page?"
msgstr "Watter Grafiekmodus wil jy by verstek vertoon hê wanneer jy die Grafieke-bladsy die eerste keer besoek?"

