#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Depending on the number of logins and use of spine data collector, %s will need many connections.  The calculation for spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), then you must leave headroom for user connections, which will change depending on the number of concurrent login accounts."
msgstr "Afhangende van die aantal aanmeldings en gebruik van Spine-dataversamelaar, sal %s baie verbindings benodig. Die berekening vir Spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), dan moet jy vrye ruimte laat vir gebruikersverbindings, wat sal verander afhangende van die aantal gelyktydige aanmeldrekeninge."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "If using the Kadupul Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine, you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr "As jy die Kadupul-prestasieversneller gebruik en 'n geheuebergingenjin kies, moet jy versigtig wees om jou prestasieversneller-buffer leeg te maak voordat die stelsel sonder geheuetabelspasie raak. Dit word op twee maniere gedoen: eerstens deur die grootte van jou uitvoerkolom tot presies die regte grootte te verklein. Hierdie kolom is in die tabelle poller_output en poller_output_boost. Die tweede ding wat jy kan doen, is om meer geheue aan geheuetabelle toe te ken. Ons het arbitrêr 'n aanbevole waarde van 10%% van die stelselgeheue gekies, maar as jy SSD-skyfaandrywers gebruik of 'n kleiner stelsel het, kan jy hierdie aanbeveling ignoreer of 'n ander bergingenjin kies. Jy kan die verwagte verbruik van die prestasieversneller-tabelle sien onder Konsole -> Stelselnutsmiddels -> Bekyk Boost-status."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 200 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 100000 can be used."
msgstr "As jy SSD-skywe het, gebruik hierdie voorstel. As jy fisieke hardeskywe het, gebruik 200 * die aantal aktiewe aandrywers in die skikking. As jy NVMe of PCIe Flash gebruik, kan veel groter getalle tot 100000 gebruik word."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 2000 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 200000 can be used."
msgstr "As jy SSD-skywe het, gebruik hierdie voorstel. As jy fisieke hardeskywe het, gebruik 2000 * die aantal aktiewe aandrywers in die skikking. As jy NVMe of PCIe Flash gebruik, kan veel groter getalle tot 200000 gebruik word."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion. Otherwise, do not set this setting."
msgstr "As jy SSD-skywe het, gebruik hierdie voorstel. Andersins, moenie hierdie instelling stel nie."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If your tables have very large indexes, you must operate with the Barracuda innodb_file_format and the innodb_large_prefix equal to 1.  Failure to do this may result in plugins that can not properly create tables."
msgstr "As jou tabelle baie groot indekse het, moet jy met die Barracuda innodb_file_format en innodb_large_prefix gelyk aan 1 werk. Versuim om dit te doen kan veroorsaak dat inproppe nie tabelle behoorlik kan skep nie."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "InnoDB will hold as much tables and indexes in system memory as is possible.  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the /var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are recommending 25%% of your systems total memory, but your requirements will vary depending on your systems size."
msgstr "InnoDB sal soveel tabelle en indekse as moontlik in stelselgeheue hou. Daarom moet jy die innodb_buffer_pool groot genoeg maak om soveel van die tabelle en indekse as moontlik in geheue te hou. Om die grootte van die /var/lib/mysql/cacti-gids na te gaan sal help om hierdie waarde te bepaal. Ons beveel 25%% van jou stelsel se totale geheue aan, maar jou vereistes sal wissel na gelang van jou stelsel se grootte."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is STRONGLY recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.5.3."
msgstr "Dit word STERK aanbeveel dat jy InnoDB aktiveer in enige %s-weergawe hoër as 5.5.3."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.1."
msgstr "Dit word aanbeveel dat jy InnoDB aktiveer in enige %s-weergawe hoër as 5.1."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Keeping the table cache larger means less file open/close operations when using innodb_file_per_table."
msgstr "Om die tabelkasgeheue groter te hou beteken minder lêer-oopmaak/-toemaakbewerkings wanneer innodb_file_per_table gebruik word."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum I/O performance happens when you use the O_DIRECT method to flush pages."
msgstr "Maksimum I/O-prestasie vind plaas wanneer jy die O_DIRECT-metode gebruik om bladsye leeg te maak."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "MySQL 5.6+ and MariaDB 10.0+ are great releases, and are very good versions to choose. Make sure you run the very latest release though which fixes a long standing low level networking issue that was causing spine many issues with reliability."
msgstr "MySQL 5.6+ en MariaDB 10.0+ is uitstekende vrystellings en baie goeie weergawes om te kies. Maak egter seker jy gebruik die heel nuutste vrystelling wat 'n langdurige laevlak-netwerkprobleem regstel wat vir spine baie betroubaarheidsprobleme veroorsaak het."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Note: Many changes below require a database restart"
msgstr "Let wel: Baie veranderinge hieronder vereis 'n databasis-herbegin"

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP %s is the minimum version"
msgstr "PHP %s is die minimum weergawe"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Recommended Value"
msgstr "Aanbevole waarde"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Rogue queries should not for the database to go offline to others.  Kill these queries before they kill your system."
msgstr "Skelm navrae moet nie veroorsaak dat die databasis vir ander vanlyn gaan nie. Beëindig hierdie navrae voordat hulle jou stelsel doodmaak."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Setting this value to 2 means that you will flush all transactions every second rather than at commit.  This allows %s to perform writing less often."
msgstr "Om hierdie waarde op 2 te stel beteken dat jy alle transaksies elke sekonde sal spoel eerder as by vaslegging (commit).  Dit laat %s toe om minder gereeld te skryf."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This is where metadata is stored. If you had a lot of tables, it would be useful to increase this."
msgstr "Hierdie is waar metadata gestoor word. As jy baie tabelle het, sal dit nuttig wees om dit te verhoog."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This settings should remain ON unless your Kadupul instances is running on either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr "Hierdie instelling moet AAN bly tensy jou Kadupul-instansies op óf ZFS óf FusionI/O loop wat albei interne joernalering het om skielike stelselontwrigtings te hanteer.  As jy egter baie goeie krag het, en jou stelsels selde afgaan en jy rugsteune het, kan die AF-stel van hierdie instelling jou byna 'n 50% toename in databasiswerkverrigting besorg."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Veranderlike"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When executing subqueries, having a larger temporary table size, keep those temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Wanneer subnavrae uitgevoer word, hou 'n groter tydelike tabelgrootte daardie tydelike tabelle in geheue."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When performing joins, if they are below this size, they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80%.  If the recommendation is negative, you must decrease this and or the sort_buffer_size until the recommendation fits within the allowable memory."
msgstr "Wanneer joins uitgevoer word, as hulle onder hierdie grootte is, sal hulle in geheue gehou word en nooit na 'n tydelike lêer geskryf word nie.  Aangesien dit 'n per-verbinding geheuetoekenning is, moet sorg gedra word om dit nie te hoog te verhoog nie.  Die som van die join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Kern MySQL/MariaDB-geheue moet onder 80% wees.  As die aanbeveling negatief is, moet jy hierdie en/of die sort_buffer_size verlaag totdat die aanbeveling binne die toelaatbare geheue pas."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "When using InnoDB storage it is important to keep your table spaces separate.  This makes managing the tables simpler for long time users of %s.  If you are running with this currently off, you can migrate to the per file storage by enabling the feature, and then running an alter statement on all InnoDB tables."
msgstr "Wanneer InnoDB-berging gebruik word, is dit belangrik om jou tabelspasies apart te hou.  Dit maak die bestuur van die tabelle eenvoudiger vir langtermyn-gebruikers van %s.  As jy tans met hierdie af loop, kan jy na die per-lêer-berging migreer deur die kenmerk te aktiveer, en dan 'n alter-stelling op alle InnoDB-tabelle uit te voer."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Kadupul with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4 character set as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Wanneer Kadupul met ander tale as Engels gebruik word, is dit belangrik om die utf8mb4-karakterstel te gebruik aangesien sommige karakters meer as 'n enkele greep neem."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Kadupul with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation type as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Wanneer Kadupul met ander tale as Engels gebruik word, is dit belangrik om die utf8mb4_unicode_ci-kollasietipe te gebruik aangesien sommige karakters meer as 'n enkele greep neem."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, this setting should be off if atomic writes are enabled.  Therefore, please enable atomic writes instead of the double write buffer as it will increase performance."
msgstr "Wanneer MariaDB 10.2.4 en hoër gebruik word, moet hierdie instelling af wees as atomiese skryfbewerkings geaktiveer is.  Aktiveer dus asseblief atomiese skryfbewerkings in plaas van die dubbelskryf-buffer aangesien dit werkverrigting sal verhoog."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, you can use atomic writes over the doublewrite buffer to increase performance."
msgstr "Wanneer MariaDB 10.2.4 en hoër gebruik word, kan jy atomiese skryfbewerkings bo die dubbelskryf-buffer gebruik om werkverrigting te verhoog."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using innodb_file_per_table, it is important to set the innodb_file_format to Barracuda.  This setting will allow longer indexes important for certain Kadupul tables."
msgstr "Wanneer innodb_file_per_table gebruik word, is dit belangrik om die innodb_file_format op Barracuda te stel.  Hierdie instelling sal langer indekse toelaat wat belangrik is vir sekere Kadupul-tabelle."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With Remote polling capabilities, large amounts of data will be synced from the main server to the remote pollers.  Therefore, keep this value at or above 16M."
msgstr "Met Afgeleë peiling-vermoëns sal groot hoeveelhede data vanaf die hoofbediener na die afgeleë pollers gesinkroniseer word.  Hou hierdie waarde dus op of bo 16M."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Met moderne SSD-tipe berging is dit voordelig om veelvuldige io-drade te hê vir toepassings met hoë io-eienskappe."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Met moderne SSD-tipe berging is dit voordelig om veelvuldige lees-io-drade te hê vir toepassings met hoë io-eienskappe."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Met moderne SSD-tipe berging is dit voordelig om veelvuldige lees-io-drade te hê vir toepassings met hoë io-eienskappe.  Afhangende van jou MariaDB/MySQL-weergawes kan hierdie waarde so hoog as 64 gaan.  Maar probeer om die getal minder as jou totale SMT-drade op die databasisbediener te hou."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Met moderne SSD-tipe berging is dit voordelig om veelvuldige skryf-io-drade te hê vir toepassings met hoë io-eienskappe."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Met moderne SSD-tipe berging is dit voordelig om veelvuldige skryf-io-drade te hê vir toepassings met hoë io-eienskappe.  Afhangende van jou MariaDB/MySQL-weergawes kan hierdie waarde so hoog as 64 gaan.  Maar probeer om die getal minder as jou totale SMT-drade op die databasisbediener te hou."

